# Frontend rules

- Use TypeScript strict; avoid `any`.
- Prefer feature modules under `features/` for domain UI.
- Keep `components/ui` generic (shadcn/Radix only).
- Validate user/IPC input with Zod before invoke.
- Use TanStack Query for IPC reads/mutations; Zustand for ephemeral UI.
- Support RTL with logical Tailwind classes (`ps-`, `pe-`, `ms-`, `me-`).
- Handle loading, empty, and error states on every data view.
- Do not call `invoke` directly in components — use `lib/tauri.ts`.
